flowchart TD
  A[Browse store] --> B[Load current catalog]
  B -->|failure| C[Visible retry with independent content]
  C -->|retry| B
  B -->|empty| D[Consultation or memberships]
  B -->|ready| E{Item type and access}
  E -->|hidden training| F[Pricing inquiry]
  E -->|public physical or granted training| G[Compare known facts]
  G --> H{Authenticated and sellable}
  H -->|no| I[Sign in or unavailable reason]
  I --> A
  H -->|yes| J[Single cart mutation]
  J -->|failed| K[Visible error and deliberate retry]
  K --> G
  J -->|receipt| L[Existing checkout]
  L -->|cancel or defer| A
  L --> M[Verify payment and fulfillment]
  M -->|unknown| N[Retry verification or support]
  N --> M
  M -->|fulfilled| O[Reduced-motion aware celebration]
  A -->|rollback release| P[Restore prior main without data changes]
